OL,13,     Fcondition after a devastating
OL,14,     Fstroke. Meanwhile, surgeons must
OL,15,     Fremove a tumour in 42-year-old
OL,16,     FDayan's neck - without surgery he
OL,17,     Fcould face paralysis.
