OL,5,G2200 Surgeons: A Matter of Life or
OL,6,G     Death
OL,7,     FA cardiac surgeon performs a heart
OL,8,     Ftransplant on mum Katie after a
OL,9,     Fthree-month hospital wait, and
OL,10,     F75-year-old grandfather Edward
OL,11,     Fneeds surgery for aggressive
OL,12,     Fkidney cancer.
OL,13,G2300 A&E After Dark
OL,14,     FThe team at Hull Royal Infirmary
OL,15,     Fhas another busy night: a man is
OL,16,     Finvolved in a motorbike collision
OL,17,     Fwith a deer and a young patient is
OL,18,     Fin agony with his ankle facing the
OL,19,     Fwrong way.
